# A borrow is the one request that is never retried for the reader, so the
# offline answer to POST /jobs has to say plainly that nothing happened. The
# search runs first, then the network is taken away before the tap that borrows.
clean
tap Title, author, or ISBN
type dune
tap Search
wait-for Results
tap Dune
wait-for Book details
scenario offline
tap Montréal
wait-for not on a network
expect nothing was borrowed
expect Book details
clean
scenario normal
